' The shared look of the manual's Graphviz diagrams. A <name>.<lang>.puml
' whose text, after PlantUML's preprocessor, is a Graphviz graph is drawn
' with Graphviz (render.sh): PlantUML's own preprocessor fills in the texts
' and the colours, Graphviz lays out tables better than PlantUML does.
' Colours from theme.iuml, as in the PlantUML diagrams; text in Arial, which
' render.sh widens to the same font stack. render.sh draws one SVG unit as
' one pixel, so the sizes here are in pixels, as in style.iuml.
!include theme.iuml

!$font = "Arial"
!$fontSize = 14
!$smallSize = 13
!$tinySize = 12
' A line break inside a text of an HTML label; a text can contain it
' ("first" + $br + "second").
!$br = '<br align="left"/>'
